{"text":"For lower back pain, place the TENS pads on either side of the painful area, near the muscles surrounding the spine. Avoid placing pads directly over the spine or on bony areas. Common placements include: Two pads on each side of the lower back, above the hips or surrounding the area where you feel pain.

